<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;India raised its fiscal-year growth forecast while security forces in Chhattisgarh uncovered a major Maoist weapons cache, recovering two IEDs. In Kashmir, LG Manoj Sinha chaired meetings, ordered a crackdown on terror modules and tighter counter-infiltration grids, and the Mirwaiz called for the release of political prisoners and restoration of civil liberties. In Manipur, a district shutdown began after two Kuki youths went missing, the state announced ex-gratia for families of 32 Kuki-Zo civilians killed, and the census was deferred with the Registrar General notifying the delay, while the state seeks relaxation of PAP rules for Indian-origin tourists. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/india-increases-growth-forecast-for-fiscal-year/a-79798971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQcjlObWF0cmVoVXljV2pRTVFxaWJkaURteXJvMXZ1SjlCMnpvbGdqeHFxeVlDSzRQZkxxTkE4RldOQ2F4U2ZoM2J4MDlWelUyTElBTk1aYjFEUUJicS1lekhEMU1DUjZkcXVMT05OM2hnQ1A3Zkpyb2ZUcDhkYzk0OU9ER0JoSklIdHNxUWtqS3BqUWdCQlJIU1JlWi0waEdDcjRmTEg5RjdEM0lTLWZZTzZoZTA1ald4YmFJNjNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Reader&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir News Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQkpyNzZoZnYwU0l6NjlCUDJMODVtN1pqTHpjdngwbXZESFVmVE9ONjBuYTdQcEVFNFpWS1pVNktnOE5WOWJEZzNfcVlSVDhSMS0zYWM0MHBvdEpCbUlhaGx1RGZ5cDNIaHN